        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/40 text-center space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-white font-bold">
            Understand the Investment Potential of Nande-Mahalunge
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 max-w-lg mx-auto">
            Connect with our advisory desk to receive confidential comparative yield studies, infrastructure roadmaps, and early EOI briefing packs.
          </p>
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-interest="Nande Mahalunge Market Impact EOI"
            class="btn-shimmer px-8 py-3 rounded-full bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs shadow-lg hover:bg-gold-300 transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            Request Investor Briefing Pack
          </button>
        </div>

      </div>

